00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:23.340
I was like is this is this not gonna live up to kind of the hype of like the nostalgia everyone has and that I have.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:32.140
Yeah, I think that's a I think that is a concern because you you immediately I don't know about you but I immediately want to put it on the essential games list because it's like a no brainer.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.200
