00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:39.620
Right. What if this is too old now?

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.260
And will it ever be too old?

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.840
I guess is a good question as well.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:49.740
