01:19:22.940 --> 01:19:24.760
Yeah, it's almost like I want to get that mushroom,

01:19:24.860 --> 01:19:28.000
but I also know that I'm probably going to die trying to get it, so what's the point?

01:19:28.160 --> 01:19:32.500
Like, yeah, like those mushrooms, it's like, yeah, I'm probably going to die if I get in this thing,

01:19:32.520 --> 01:19:33.540
so I don't understand the point.

01:19:33.560 --> 01:19:36.300
It's like, just get to my death faster, I guess.

01:19:36.300 --> 01:19:40.760
I know I'm going to get killed later on in this level, but that is kind of cool.

01:19:40.760 --> 01:19:44.740
It's like a neat little thing that's like, it's not repetitive that you keep fighting the same Bowser,

01:19:44.800 --> 01:19:46.180
because you're not fighting the same Bowser.

01:19:46.180 --> 01:19:53.000
Those are each one of his, you know, members of his Koopa tribe taking on the disguise of Bowser,

01:19:53.020 --> 01:19:58.800
and then finally in 8-4, you get the real Bowser, and boy is he tough, okay,

01:19:58.920 --> 01:20:02.260
