01:20:32.940 --> 01:20:37.240
And I also like, in terms of how he throws the hammers, he throws them all kind of at once.

01:20:37.240 --> 01:20:41.340
If you just stay back a little, watch him throw the hammers, get up close,

01:20:41.380 --> 01:20:45.740
and then hope he jumps instead of throws the hammers again, you're in for a pretty good time.

01:20:45.900 --> 01:20:50.640
Yeah, if you've learned one thing listening to this podcast the past however many weeks,

01:20:50.880 --> 01:20:52.460
it's that strategy.

01:20:52.720 --> 01:20:57.480
Yeah, that's like the only good strategy, that's the only good sound of advice we've given on this podcast,

