01:24:00.440 --> 01:24:02.460
They're not just like, oh, just follow it along.

01:24:02.600 --> 01:24:03.720
It's like, follow it along.

01:24:03.840 --> 01:24:04.880
Jump over these obstacles.

01:24:05.060 --> 01:24:06.740
Make sure it stays on the screen the whole time.

01:24:06.800 --> 01:24:09.800
