01:24:16.380 --> 01:24:19.240
Yeah. You know, they're not just like, hey, three strikes and you're out.

01:24:19.380 --> 01:24:22.980
It's like, three strikes or you might not want to play this game again for a whole nother day.

01:24:23.200 --> 01:24:24.660
