01:26:03.240 --> 01:26:10.420
games, and just, like, games in general, is the idea that there is no, like, hey, this mushroom does that.

01:26:10.420 --> 01:26:12.380
Or, hey, stomp on this Goomba.

01:26:12.520 --> 01:26:13.760
