01:26:37.600 --> 01:26:39.060
And I think, like, Mario Bros.

01:26:39.120 --> 01:26:44.520
does that really well. Because if you think about it, that first mushroom, it's really, like, unavoidable if you just test it out.

01:26:44.600 --> 01:26:50.180
